---
import Badge from "./Badge.astro"
---

<h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold text-center mb-8 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">My Experience</h1>
<ol class="relative border-s border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">                  
    
    <li class="mb-10 ms-4">
        <div class="absolute w-3 h-3 bg-gray-200 rounded-full mt-1.5 -start-1.5 border border-white dark:border-gray-900 dark:bg-gray-700"></div>
        <time class="mb-1 text-sm font-normal leading-none text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">February 2025 - September 2025</time>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Data Science Intern - BizBat</h3>
        <p class="text-base font-normal text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
            Normalized and unified user and event data in BigQuery, implementing automated pipelines for continuous data injection and dashboard updates. KPI Monitoring & Reporting: Led reporting using GA4 and developed interactive dashboards in Looker Studio, defining and reporting key KPIs for strategic decision-making. Collaborated on GCP infrastructure optimization and data preparation for subsequent Machine Learning model training.
        </p>
        <Badge>Data Science</Badge><Badge>BigQuery</Badge><Badge>Google Cloud</Badge><Badge>GA4</Badge><Badge>LockerStudio</Badge><Badge>Python</Badge><Badge>SQL</Badge>
    </li>
	<li class="mb-10 ms-4">
        <div class="absolute w-3 h-3 bg-gray-200 rounded-full mt-1.5 -start-1.5 border border-white dark:border-gray-900 dark:bg-gray-700"></div>
        <time class="mb-1 text-sm font-normal leading-none text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">November 2024 - April 2025</time>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Startup Incubator - Gamified Reading Platform</h3>
        <p class="text-base font-normal text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
            AI Architecture and Automation: Designed a complex AI architecture utilizing APIs (Whisper) for transcription, processing output with an LLM for reading comprehension scoring and feedback. Automated the data flow, including gamified data updates, using an n8n container for user analysis and reading enhancement. Business Validation: Led the business model validation phase, defining market strategies and analyzing potential user research to guide product development.
        </p>
        <Badge>Business Model</Badge><Badge>Gamification</Badge><Badge>AI</Badge><Badge>Startup Validation</Badge><Badge>AI Architecture</Badge><Badge>Automation</Badge>
    </li>
	<li class="mb-10 ms-4">
        <div class="absolute w-3 h-3 bg-gray-200 rounded-full mt-1.5 -start-1.5 border border-white dark:border-gray-900 dark:bg-gray-700"></div>
        <time class="mb-1 text-sm font-normal leading-none text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">August 2024 - February 2025</time>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Mobile App Development - RapidRead</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-base font-normal text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
            Developed a React Native mobile app with Expo and Firebase. RapidRead helps users improve reading speed and comprehension through personalized, gamified exercises, with support for uploading and practicing with custom documents.
        </p>
        <Badge>React Native</Badge><Badge>Expo</Badge><Badge>Firebase</Badge><Badge>UI/UX</Badge>
    </li>

    <li class="mb-10 ms-4">
        <div class="absolute w-3 h-3 bg-gray-200 rounded-full mt-1.5 -start-1.5 border border-white dark:border-gray-900 dark:bg-gray-700"></div>
        <time class="mb-1 text-sm font-normal leading-none text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">March 2024 - August 2024</time>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Freelance Fullstack Developer - Dr. Leon Clinic</h3>
        <p class="text-base font-normal text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
            Designed and developed a web application for a clinic to streamline patient management, including medical records, clinical data, and appointment scheduling. Built the database, backend, and frontend to optimize efficiency and user experience.
        </p>
        <Badge>React</Badge><Badge>Node.js</Badge><Badge>MySQL</Badge><Badge>Tailwind CSS</Badge><Badge>REST API</Badge><Badge>Express.js</Badge><Badge>Vite</Badge>
    </li>

    <li class="mb-10 ms-4">
        <div class="absolute w-3 h-3 bg-gray-200 rounded-full mt-1.5 -start-1.5 border border-white dark:border-gray-900 dark:bg-gray-700"></div>
        <time class="mb-1 text-sm font-normal leading-none text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">July 2018 - February 2019</time>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Math Olympiad Instructor & Mentor</h3>
        <p class="text-base font-normal text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
            Directed a 7-month training program for CECyT 16's math olympiad team, developing personalized curricula 
            and innovative teaching methodologies.
        </p>
        <Badge>Pedagogy</Badge><Badge>Curriculum Design</Badge><Badge>Competition Training</Badge><Badge>Leadership</Badge>
    </li>
    
</ol>
